tions":0,"shares":15152493,"bookValue":347.864,"ocfTTM":-728009984,"fcfTTM":-1646448768,"cash":193400000,"debt":1942700032,"opMargins":0.07105,"profitMargins":0.05125,"beta":null,"currentRatio":1.542,"revGrowth":0.154,"earnGrowth":-0.586,"fwdEps":null,"peg":null,"grossMargins":0.39922002,"summary":"Jubilant Agri and Consumer Products Limited manufactures and sells performance polymers, chemicals, and agri products in India and internationally. It operates through Performance Polymers & Chemicals, P&K Fertilizers, and Agri Nutrients segments. The company offers consumer products, including woodworking adhesives and wood finishes under the Jivanjor, Vamicol, Polystic Plus, Hero, Charmwood, and Ultra Italia brands; and maintenance products comprising epoxy adhesive systems, sealants, instant adhesives, maintenance sprays, epoxy putty compounds, and paper glue products. It also provides food polymers, such as polyvinyl acetate for the chewing gum industry under the Vamipol brand; and ester gum that is used to produce the gum base for chewing and bubble gum under the Jubigum brand. In addition, the company offers synthetic latex products under the Encord brand comprising vinyl pyridine latex for the dipping of tyre cord fabrics, belting fabrics, and chafers; styrene butadiene for the dipping of tyre cord fabrics, belting fabrics, and chafers in blend with VP latex; and nitrile butadiene rubber latex for automotive gasket jointing. Further, it provides crop nutrition products, such as single super phosphate fertilizer in both powder and granulated forms under the Ramban brand; nitrogen, phosphorus, and potassium agri-nutrient products; and bio-stimulants. Additionally, the company offers chlormequat chloride under the VAM-C brand; sulphuric acid; and plant macro and micronutrient products, including phosphorus, sulphur, zinc, calcium, boron, iron, copper, molybdenum, manganese, mycorrhiza, magnesium, and plant growth regulators. It exports its products. The company was incorporated in 2008 and is based in Gurugram, India. Jubilant Agri and Consumer Products Limited operates as a subsidiary of Jubilant Industries Limited.","employees":1579,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795440536},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440535,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Jubilant Agri and Consumer Products\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Jubilant Agri & Cons Investor Analysis | StockIQ","s":"The Economic Times","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPcFBWVVFJNEt2cnZESFpGT2pDV3ZERFhTNUtCckk1NmFzRElhQ2JtbTNBNWZpaGtqaHU3eUFMNTRqbWZOUElqN3puT3p4c3JvRW5Kd2RlS0RhS3lvNUJRVUgySEduTk5JeFdVX2tGMzZWc1EtSFFEX240dnROdFlBdG5kTEQ0YktMUGlIcDZiSVM4VVRBVWV0cElCNkRBWV81UnFUZktXTXdHaXM?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Jubilant Agri and Consumer Products (NSEI:JUBLCPL) - Stock Analysis","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1795075200,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPQk5PbE81NHpLTHYtQWJpYWtSLWo3cTlJbThFcHlYVmxWX1dFTDF2S25hbjZZbjdZU0k3b1pVbHdIclBkdjM2MUNINC1oZ3JGMXFrc1hQaXk2eUtSY0RROE9fb3hJUzdoby04NHhoQlhsMUtjYlFWSWRQbElmZFFUV2dqOHAzLVp5SHBjcG5RdTRHQnNKQ1BGc0o3WV8?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Jubilant Agri Q2 FY27 Results Set for Board Review on Nov 5","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1793884084,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNMW14d21KY050N19QR2IyelY0OFdxcmE5WnJiQ2pla3Rhd0RkX2Q5X0lJNTdINGlfaS1CLWE3OHdlY0p0U0t6M3F1b2FzUkFLSGpEcko2MnZEaGpNZHE0STZFMGNWRS0xc2tveC1mQ1d3MmRCeWRkb09QQW1LeHFZN3c4UlQ3amYtRU9NWi1Gbk1iZkFtb0RMbVVydHBvakhRWnhZMnFlSQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Jubilant Agri (NSE:JUBLCPL): Understanding the NCLT Hearing Notice on Proposed Scheme of Arrangement","s":"Kalkine Media","d":1793170800,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":["legal"]},{"t":"E-Way Bill Part B Not Mandatory for Initial Movement Within 50 Km: GSTAT Ghaziabad","s":"TaxGuru","d":1792047600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOVW4wUHlaYnhKcjA1c19nY0Rsd2ZKZEw